<%# The record badge: one neutral pill holding the gold trophy and the short
    label, naming every record the workout currently holds — whether the
    viewer is the owner (live records) or a permitted viewer of a publication
    snapshot. Only the gold place is ever a badge here; second and third
    personal places stay in the owner's tables (DESIGN.md §10.4). Never
    rendered when empty. `compact` keeps the trophy alone (workout cards). %>
<% labels = Array(local_assigns.fetch(:labels, [])) %>
<% if labels.any? %>
  <%= personal_place_badge(1, tooltip: t("medals.records", records: labels.join(" · "), count: labels.size),
                              text: t("workouts.show.records.badge_short"),
                              extra_classes: "allure-record-badge",
                              compact: local_assigns.fetch(:compact, false)) %>
<% end %>
